%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client as Client (SDK or HTTP)
  participant Mw as apiKeyMiddleware
  participant Route as permissions.check handler
  participant Cache as permissionCache (60s TTL)
  participant DB as Postgres (via Prisma)

  Client->>Mw: GET /v1/permissions/check + Bearer jk_...<br/>?userId, groupId, permission
  Mw->>DB: ApiKey by prefix
  DB-->>Mw: gameId + hashedSecret
  Mw->>Mw: scrypt verify, check revokedAt
  Mw->>Route: c.var.gameId set, next()

  Route->>DB: Group WHERE id AND gameId AND softDeletedAt IS NULL
  DB-->>Route: group or null
  opt group missing or cross-game
    Route-->>Client: 404 not_found
  end

  Route->>Cache: get(gameId, groupId, userId, permission)
  alt cache hit (within 60s, not invalidated)
    Cache-->>Route: PermissionCheckResult
    Route-->>Client: 200 OK (cached)
  else cache miss
    Cache-->>Route: null
    Route->>DB: ExternalIdentity (gameId, externalUserId)
    DB-->>Route: junjoUserId or null
    alt no identity
      Route->>Cache: set { source: "none" }
      Route-->>Client: 200 { source: "none" }
    else identity resolved
      Route->>DB: GroupMember (groupId, junjoUserId)
      DB-->>Route: { status } or null
      alt no row, or status != active
        Route->>Cache: set { source: "none" }
        Route-->>Client: 200 { source: "none" }
      else active member
        Route->>DB: MemberPermissionOverride (memberId, key)
        DB-->>Route: { grant } or null
        alt override present
          Route->>Cache: set { source: "override" }
          Route-->>Client: 200 { source: "override", allowed: grant }
        else no override
          Route->>DB: MemberRole JOIN RolePermission<br/>ORDER BY priority DESC, roleId DESC
          DB-->>Route: { roleId } or null
          alt role grants the key
            Route->>Cache: set { source: "role", viaRoleId }
            Route-->>Client: 200 { source: "role", allowed: true }
          else no role grants
            Route->>Cache: set { source: "default" }
            Route-->>Client: 200 { source: "default", allowed: false }
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end

  Note over Client,DB: Mutations (role assign/remove, role permission grant/revoke,<br/>member override set/clear, role delete) call cache.invalidateGroup(groupId)<br/>after commit, so a stale "false" can flip to "true" within one round-trip.
